## Notes on the software

**No third-party code.** Rookeepa contains no bundled libraries, fonts, icons or
other third-party works. Every line of JavaScript, CSS and SVG is part of this
repository and is covered by the licence above. The app loads no external
resources at runtime.

**Rookeepa is an independent project.** It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
sponsored by, or derived from any other accounting or bookkeeping product, and
no code, artwork, text or data from another product is included. Account codes,
account names, tax codes and report layouts are ordinary conventions of
bookkeeping and of Australian tax reporting (Activity Statement boxes such as
G1, 1A and 1B are published by the Australian Taxation Office), not the
intellectual property of any vendor.

**Not advice.** Rookeepa is bookkeeping software. It is not accounting, tax or
financial advice, it is not connected to the Australian Taxation Office or any
other revenue authority, and it does not lodge anything on your behalf. Check
the figures with a registered accountant or tax agent before you rely on them.
